        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  <!-- Section 2: Every Nano <-> Micro Conversion (8 Distinct Tints) -->
  <section id="converters" class="content-section">
    <div class="section-title-wrap">
      <h2>Every Nano ↔ Micro Conversion</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        From semiconductor physics and molecular biology to RF engineering and electrochemistry, select any metric tier below for dedicated calculators, step-by-step math, and printable reference charts.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="category-cards-grid">
      <!-- 1. Length (Cyan) -->
      <div class="unit-cat-card card-length">
        <div class="cat-header">
          <div class="cat-icon icon-cyan">📏</div>
