          <a href="/convert/gram-to-microgram/" class="unit-pill pill-amber">µg ↔ mg</a>
          <a href="/convert/nanograms-to-micrograms/" class="unit-pill pill-amber">ng ↔ pg</a>
          <a href="/convert/nano-to-micro/" class="unit-pill pill-amber">pg ↔ µg</a>
